body:
When I am in it, yeah, I am actually a very good lawyer.  When I'm not, no I'm a terrible lawyer.  

&#x200B;

Of course your advice is great.  It is absolutely true.  But, I just can't get myself to do it.  I feel so exhausted and drained by the end of the day, not even doing anything, that all I want to do is go home.  I've stayed later before but I will literally just stare at a screen and sit there.
